# Scratch and runtime artefacts. Kept in one place, deliberately boring:
#   - a patch script left in the tree WILL be swept into a commit by `git add -A` (F34 in two repos, and
#     mine cost an F41 merge a stray file), so scratch lives in /tmp or under an ignored name;
#   - pc-eye writes a log, a readiness marker and a downloaded tunnel binary NEXT TO the code, and a run's
#     `live/` captures may contain a screenshot of a human's desktop — none of those may ever be committed.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
tools/_p*.py
tools/_patch*.py
pceye.log
*.log
READY.txt
cloudflared
cloudflared.exe
live/
.private/
*.env
